<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 763 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 763 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks bid for 341 million zlotys of the National Bank of Poland's 182-day bills and for 422 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The NBP offered to sell 200 million zlotys worth of the bills for each term. Results of the auction should be available at about 1300 local time.   -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
